@startuml ST_01
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam stateBorderColor #263E35
title ST-01 - Reservation lifecycle
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
state "Pending collection" as Pending
state "Completed" as Completed <<terminal>>
state "Cancelled" as Cancelled <<terminal>>
[*] --> Pending : create reservation\n[customer; listed title; positive integer q; enough stock]\n/ save owner, title, q and current unit price; stock -= q
Pending --> Cancelled : cancel\n[owning customer]\n/ status = Cancelled; restore stored q once
Pending --> Completed : confirm collection\n[staff checked reference, owner, title and quantity]\n/ status = Completed; stock unchanged
Completed : cancel or confirm again / reject; no change
Cancelled : cancel or confirm again / reject; no change
note left of Pending
Creation and cancellation save state and stock
together or leave both unchanged.
Failed creation leaves no reservation object.
end note
note right of Pending
Unlisting prevents new reservations.
Existing pending records can still be
cancelled by their owner or collected by staff.
end note
note bottom of Completed
Retained terminal record, not deletion.
Saved quantity and unit price are unchanged.
Eligible for completed totals only.
end note
note bottom of Cancelled
Retained terminal record, not deletion.
Unauthorised actions leave all data unchanged.
No expiry, refund, extension or reversal.
end note
@enduml
